## 12. Deterministic Runtime Requirements

To prevent desynchronization:

* IEEE 754 float64
* FMA disabled
* Round-to-nearest-even
* Fixed tick interval
* Deterministic timestamp alignment
* Lexicographically sorted JSON serialization
* 17-digit decimal precision
* SHA-256 state anchoring

Optional:

* Fixed-point arithmetic pipelines
* Integer-domain entropy computation

